Let $x$ be the number of Post-it notes in the package Candice purchased.
Candice started with 80 post-it notes.
She used 220 post-it notes at the coffee shop.
She had 23 post-it notes remaining.
So, we can write the equation:
$80 + x - 220 = 23$
$x - 140 = 23$
$x = 23 + 140$
$x = 163$

Therefore, the package contained 163 post-it notes.

####163 [end of text]


